---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data: the files in data/ contain published statistics transcribed from
D. Card, J. Kluve and A. Weber (2018), "What works? A meta analysis of recent
active labor market program evaluations", Journal of the European Economic
Association 16(3), 894-931, https://doi.org/10.1093/jeea/jvx028, and from the
NBER working-paper version of that article. Please cite the original source
when reusing them.

Icons: the files in figures_src/icons/ are from Tabler Icons
(https://tabler.io/icons), MIT licence, see figures_src/icons/LICENSE_tabler_icons.txt.
